    narr: 'Adding A_y opens the box into a flat rectangle in the xy-plane; the red arrow is now the diagonal of that rectangle, with magnitude √(Ax² + Ay²).'
  },
  {
    title: 'Three components — a space vector', ax: 3, ay: 4, az: 4, ht: false,
    narr: 'Raising A_z inflates the rectangle into the dashed box and the red arrow becomes its body diagonal, reaching the far corner: |A| = √(Ax² + Ay² + Az²).'
